# shell: desktop
# The rows a person works: an entry takes the keyboard once clicked and
# writes on Return, a slider takes the value under the pointer, a choice
# is pressed through its words.  Each lands in the place the row named.
wait 12
note the description opens as a panel
click-row 4
wait 3
click-row 4
wait 12
expect-title Input
note the entry takes the keyboard once clicked and writes on Return
click 560 224
wait 4
key h
key i
key Return
wait 6
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_input/name workshophi
note Escape lets go without writing
click 560 224
wait 4
key x
key Escape
wait 6
expect-file-lacks /tmp/trk_input/name workshophix
note the slider takes the value under the pointer: three quarters along
click 601 252
wait 6
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_input/bright 75
note and the knob follows the hand, the place written when it lets go
press 500 252
wait 2
move 641 252
wait 2
release 641 252
wait 6
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_input/bright 100
note the choice is pressed through its words
click 560 280
wait 6
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_input/mode fast
click 560 280
wait 6
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_input/mode slow
shot /tmp/trk_input_done.png
quit
